step	1	-	Quick guide step 1
line	<col=000080>Speak to <col=800000>Grish</col> located in <col=800000>Jiggig</col> west of the <col=800000>Gu'Tanoth</col> and south of <col=800000>Castle Wars</col> (east of <col=800000>fairy ring</col> BKP) and offer to help.</col>
step	2	-	Quick guide step 2
line	<str>Speak to Grish located in Jiggig west of the Gu'Tanoth and south of Castle Wars (east of fairy ring BKP) and offer to help.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Speak to <col=800000>Ogre guard</col> to the east, he will remove the barricade to gain access to the Zogre-infested area.</col>
step	3	-	Quick guide step 3
line	<str>Speak to Grish located in Jiggig west of the Gu'Tanoth and south of Castle Wars (east of fairy ring BKP) and offer to help.</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak to Ogre guard to the east, he will remove the barricade to gain access to the Zogre-infested area.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Climb over the <col=800000>crushed barricade</col> and run east to a set of stairs going downwards, go down these stairs.</col>
step	4	-	Quick guide step 4
line	<str>Speak to Grish located in Jiggig west of the Gu'Tanoth and south of Castle Wars (east of fairy ring BKP) and offer to help.</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak to Ogre guard to the east, he will remove the barricade to gain access to the Zogre-infested area.</str>
line	
line	<str>Climb over the crushed barricade and run east to a set of stairs going downwards, go down these stairs.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Run north-west to an area with a blackened floor, a short cut scene will begin.</col>
step	5	-	Quick guide step 5
line	<str>Speak to Grish located in Jiggig west of the Gu'Tanoth and south of Castle Wars (east of fairy ring BKP) and offer to help.</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak to Ogre guard to the east, he will remove the barricade to gain access to the Zogre-infested area.</str>
line	
line	<str>Climb over the crushed barricade and run east to a set of stairs going downwards, go down these stairs.</str>
line	
line	<str>Run north-west to an area with a blackened floor, a short cut scene will begin.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Search the <col=800000>skeleton</col> next to the <col=800000>broken lectern</col>. A <col=800000>Zombie</col> will appear and attack, kill it to obtain the <col=800000>Ruined backpack</col>.</col>
step	6	-	Quick guide step 6
line	<str>Speak to Grish located in Jiggig west of the Gu'Tanoth and south of Castle Wars (east of fairy ring BKP) and offer to help.</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak to Ogre guard to the east, he will remove the barricade to gain access to the Zogre-infested area.</str>
line	
line	<str>Climb over the crushed barricade and run east to a set of stairs going downwards, go down these stairs.</str>
line	
line	<str>Run north-west to an area with a blackened floor, a short cut scene will begin.</str>
line	
line	<str>Search the skeleton next to the broken lectern. A Zombie will appear and attack, kill it to obtain the Ruined backpack.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Open the <col=800000>ruined backpack</col> to obtain a <col=800000>Dragon inn tankard</col>, some <col=800000>rotten food</col> and a <col=800000>knife</col>.</col>
step	7	-	Quick guide step 7
line	<str>Speak to Grish located in Jiggig west of the Gu'Tanoth and south of Castle Wars (east of fairy ring BKP) and offer to help.</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak to Ogre guard to the east, he will remove the barricade to gain access to the Zogre-infested area.</str>
line	
line	<str>Climb over the crushed barricade and run east to a set of stairs going downwards, go down these stairs.</str>
line	
line	<str>Run north-west to an area with a blackened floor, a short cut scene will begin.</str>
line	
line	<str>Search the skeleton next to the broken lectern. A Zombie will appear and attack, kill it to obtain the Ruined backpack.</str>
line	
line	<str>Open the ruined backpack to obtain a Dragon inn tankard, some rotten food and a knife.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Search the broken lectern for the <col=800000>Torn page</col> (make sure you keep this).</col>
