line	<str>Open the ruined backpack to obtain a Dragon inn tankard, some rotten food and a knife.</str>
line	
line	<str>Search the broken lectern for the Torn page (make sure you keep this).</str>
line	
line	<str>Attempt to search the coffin west of the Skeleton, and then use a knife on it.</str>
line	
line	<str>Attempt to open coffin (may take a couple of tries), search the coffin for the black prism.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go to the Dragon Inn in Yanille and use the dragon inn tankard on the bartender. The Minigame Teleport to Nightmare Zone can take you here quickly.</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak to Zavistic Rarve in the Wizards' Guild in Yanille (if you don't have the required level to enter, ring the bell out front). ( if you have started Hand in the Sand)</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak to Sithik Ints in his bed in the upstairs bedroom in the guest house north of the Wizards' Guild</str>
line	
line	<str>Search the drawers, cupboard and wardrobe for Book of portraiture, Necromancy book, papyrus, charcoal, and a book of 'H.A.M'.</str>
line	
line	<str>Read all three books.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use all three books on Sithik.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use Papyrus on Sithik.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use portrait on Sithik.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go to the Dragon Inn in Yanille and use the Dragon Inn Tankard, then the portrait on the Bartender.</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak to Zavistic Rarve while holding the Necromancy book, book of 'H.A.M', the tankard and the signed portrait. or {{Chat option|1I'm here about the sicks...err Zogres}{Chat option|3I have some items that I'd like you to look at.}} if you have started Hand in the Sand.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use the Strange potion on the Cup of tea on top of Sithik's drawers.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go downstairs and back upstairs.</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak to Sithik, obtain answers to all three questions in order to make Relicym's balm and Brutal arrows .</str>
line	
line	<str>Return and speak to Grish . He will give you an Ogre gate key to access the Ceremonial chamber.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Grish again "There must be an easier way to kill these Zogres" to learn how to equip Composite ogre bows .</str>
line	
line	<str>Prepare to fight Slash Bash (level 111). If you are using an comp ogre bow instead of Crumble Undead, follow the "optional" steps below.</str>
line	
line	<str>Chop an Achey Tree for logs.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use a knife on the achey tree logs with wolf bones in your inventory, and select box number (2) to create an unstrung comp bow.</str>
line	
line	<str>String the bow with bow string to create the finished bow.</str>
line	
line	<str>Either buy one from the Grand Exchange or make it yourself by adding Rogue's purse to a Vial of water and then add Snake weed. It is not needed for the quest but giving it to Uglug Nar will allow you to purchase Relicym's balm from his shop if needed in the future.</str>
line	
line	<str>Cut down Achey Trees for Achey tree logs.</str>
line	
line	<str>Fletch the logs with a knife into Ogre arrow shafts.</str>
line	
line	<str>Add feathers to the shafts.</str>
line	
line	<str>With a hammer in your inventory use nails on the Flighted ogre arrows.</str>
line	
line	<str>Head back down into Jiggig.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Travel west until you reach two sets of doors.</col>
